 "Following 21 cm paper: (2606.03729v1)\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", "(", "1000", ")"}], "=", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", 
     RowBox[{"-", "5"}]]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "6d605bc5-35d9-4594-8381-59d13c549d24"],
 ", \t\t",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", "'"}], 
     RowBox[{"(", "1000", ")"}]}], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", "9.99"}], "*", 
     SuperscriptBox["10", 
      RowBox[{"-", "9"}]]}]}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "9da5d800-ed9f-4be5-8391-d60f3db63cb9"],
 "\n\nAt high redshift indistuinguishable from GR -->\n\[ScriptCapitalR]hat = \
3(1-3w) ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
